[2026-06-27] Specialized IntTrie/Trie/zipper paths for Range, suffixClosure, TailsIntersection (fallbacks.md §1-3).
- ITrie.range / Trie.range: NATIVE ordered trie-slice. Walks in canonical (pathItemOrdering) order
